### Unix socket only: resolve an explicitly selected registered folder
POST /local/v1/projects/resolve HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost
Content-Type: application/json

{"absolute_path":"/home/owner/work/field-notes"}

### A declared member folder answers with the same project
POST /local/v1/projects/resolve HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost
Content-Type: application/json

{"absolute_path":"/home/owner/work/field-notes/server"}
